  "title": "Cook Crosses the Antarctic Circle",
  "summary": "On 17 January 1773 James Cook's HMS Resolution, sailing with HMS Adventure, became the first recorded ship to cross the Antarctic Circle. Cook's journal notes the crossing came about a quarter past eleven. He met heavy ice, turned back, and did not reach the continent.",
